## Rest
scene: 0
A quiet circle on a quiet field. Nothing has happened yet.

## Signal
scene: 1
An input leaves the circle as rings. The wave has a source and a direction.

## Scan
scene: 2
A beam sweeps round a fixed centre. The eyes follow the angle.

## Sampling
scene: 3
Seeded draws fall one at a time. Repetition turns noise into a shape.

## Convergence
scene: 4
Scroll this chapter. The scattered field settles onto a grid as you read.

## A gap
scene: 5
Some observations are missing. The gap stays visible rather than being filled in.

# Notes

Every motion here is conceptual. No dot stands for a measured value.

Each frame is computed by one Rust module compiled to WebAssembly and embedded in this page. Move a pointer over the picture to draw the circle's gaze.
